== Trivia ==
* The Cube of Meat is a reference to the game ''[[wikipedia:Super Meat Boy|Super Meat Boy]]'', developed by [[Edmund McMillen]], creator of ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* The pickup quote is a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]]'' series catchphrase "Gotta catch 'em all."
* {{dlc|nr}} Cube of Meat is found in 9 item pools, the highest count amongst all items, due to the fact that it appears in all of Greed mode's item pools.
* Cube of Meat's 3rd and 4th stage form is referred to as "Ultra Flesh Kid!" in ''The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls'', Edmund's card game.

